    "field": "Modeling of climate extremes",
    "problem": "This paper addresses a programmatic error in a previous study where global averages for several precipitation indices were incorrectly calculated by including ocean points instead of only land points, requiring a correction to the original figures and trend analysis.",
    "method": "This paper is an erratum that corrects a data processing error in a previous study by re-calculating global averages for precipitation indices using only land points, but it does not propose a new scientific method.",
    "task": "The task is to intercompare climate model simulations of historical and future changes in extreme weather and climate events.",
